  "label": "White Genocide Conspiracy Theory",
  "description": "A false and inflammatory conspiracy theory that falsely claims systemic extermination of white populations, often promoted by extremist groups and online communities. It is factually baseless and incites racial hatred and division. The theory is used to fuel fear, paranoia, and racial animosity, often targeting non-white populations as the supposed perpetrators or beneficiaries of this alleged genocide.",
